explain select ebeln from voucher_line_details force index (idx_voucher_header_id)
where voucher_header_id='4000001024-1000-2025' and ebeln is not null and ebeln<>'';
-- @regex("Index Table Scan", true)
➤ TP QUERY PLAN[12,0,0]  𝄀
Project  𝄀
  ->  Join  𝄀
        Join Type: INDEX  𝄀
        Join Cond: (voucher_line_details.voucher_line_id = __mo_index_pri_col)  𝄀
        Runtime Filter Build: #[-1,0]  𝄀
        ->  Table Scan on secondary_index_null_predicates.voucher_line_details [ForceOneCN]  𝄀
              Filter Cond: (voucher_line_details.voucher_header_id = '4000001024-1000-2025'), (voucher_line_details.ebeln IS NOT NULL), (voucher_line_details.ebeln <> '')  𝄀
              Runtime Filter Probe: voucher_line_details.voucher_line_id  𝄀
        ->  Index Table Scan on voucher_line_details.idx_voucher_header_id [ForceOneCN]  𝄀
              Filter Cond: prefix_eq(__mo_index_idx_col)
select voucher_line_id from voucher_line_details force index (idx_voucher_header_id)
where voucher_header_id='4000001024-1000-2025' and ebeln is null order by voucher_line_id;
